# The REST index for reference/rest/golden.sh (method, target, flags): the
# block editor's preload of WordPress 7.1.3 (edit-form-blocks.php), its
# fields without the image settings, other fields clients ask for; then, refused, those HyScribe answers 501
# as they keep the routes or namespaces (ADR 0013). The namespace indexes are in namespaces.list.
